          },
          "widget": {
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## What do the daily and weekly price profiles look like, and did 15-minute pricing change intra-hour variation?\n\nWeekday prices peak at 09 and 19 (1.4–1.6× the day's average) and bottom out at night; weekends average 30 €/MWh against 54. Since 15-minute pricing the quarter-hours of an hour differ by 15 €/MWh on average, more than the 8 €/MWh move from one hour to the next."
